 "x \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,i+4 \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,j+z \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4c76f153-0b49-57db-b5cc-eea784a1592e" :answer/id #uuid "4c76f153-0b49-57db-b5cc-eea784a1592e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,i+4 y \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,j+z \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e15996e3-8dfc-5760-8950-2cca21b0f2fa" :answer/id #uuid "e15996e3-8dfc-5760-8950-2cca21b0f2fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z \\sin{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,i+4 \\sin{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,j+x \\sin{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5684a5a6-02af-57f7-91ea-abac705db63f" :answer-field/id #uuid "5684a5a6-02af-57f7-91ea-abac705db63f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["61e3ecd5-7d41-5bbe-af1c-fc78ba063e65" "fdc6997b-8a72-5f8f-8cad-c0e06747a9fb" "c4603d86-4cc6-53cf-9b06-15035ef02806" "4c76f153-0b49-57db-b5cc-eea784a1592e" "e15996e3-8dfc-5760-8950-2cca21b0f2fa"] :answer-field/correct "fdc6997b-8a72-5f8f-8cad-c0e06747a9fb" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "3266754d-3a6d-5bf4-b53d-4b662bce4ae1" :question/id #uuid "3266754d-3a6d-5bf4-b53d-4b662bce4ae1" :question/problem "Find the gradient vector field of the function $f(x,y,z)=\\sin{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}.$" :question/worked-solution "The gradient vector field of a function $f$ is given by $\\nabla f.$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f_{x}(x,y,z)&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\left(\\sin{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\right) \\\\ &=z \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)} \\\\ f_{y}(x,y,z)&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\left(\\sin{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\right) \\\\ &=4 \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)} \\\\ f_{z}(x,y,z)&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}\\left(\\sin{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\right) \\\\ &=x \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the gradient vector field of $f(x,y,z)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\nabla f(x,y,z)&=f_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+f_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+f_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\ &= z \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,i+4 \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,j+x \\cos{\\left(x z + 4 y \\right)}\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["5684a5a6-02af-57f7-91ea-abac705db63f"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "4965141b-af05-5fcd-8386-729dbb0b0514" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186179714.py"} [:db/add 17592186179714 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186179714 :knowledge-point/questions ["1ea28d03-fccc-5031-9dd7-432a9072ff6e" "8e3fd408-b47b-5667-a4ab-da6a8c86196d" "3266754d-3a6d-5bf4-b53d-4b662bce4ae1"]} [:db/ensure 17592186179714 :knowledge-point/validate]]
